WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:04.003 line:0%
[ Beeping ]

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.371
-Let's a-go.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:06.906 line:0%
[ Kart engine revs ]

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.408 line:0%
-Whoo!

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:11.210 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.979 line:0%
-I am a massive fan
of "Last of Us."

00:00:13.979 --> 00:00:15.648
Obviously, I love "Mario Kart."

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.785
And this is sort
of a spiritual sequel

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:21.754 line:0%
to the sketch Streeter Seidell
and I did called

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:26.593 line:0%
"Grouch," which was marrying
Oscar the Grouch with Joker.

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:29.395 line:0%
So this is "The Last of Us"
meets "Mario Kart."

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:32.965 line:0%
You have Mario and Luigi,
Pedro Pascal as Mario.

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:34.067 line:0%
-Grazie mille.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:35.401 line:0%
Whoo-hoo!
-Whoo-hoo!

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:37.336 line:0%
You have Princess Peach,

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:39.439 line:0%
the equivalent of Ellie
in this.

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.007
-I think this is gonna
be a show.

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.174
Put it on Peacock.

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:44.143 line:0%
-And then you have Kenan
as Bowser.

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:45.944 line:0%
-I'm an actor.
I'm a professional.

00:00:45.944 --> 00:00:47.247 line:0%
I mean, there you go.

00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:49.448 line:0%
You could just put
a camera on Kenan.

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:52.351 line:0%
-Action.
-We're on the set of our

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:56.022 line:0%
post-apocalyptic "Mario Kart"
trailer, thing.

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:58.758
Every time I show up on set
and see what everyone

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.960
put together, it's always
mind-blowing.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.229 line:0%
-Starting with the biggest set,
we're calling it

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.364 line:0%
the Mario Track.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.764
-It definitely needs the patches

00:01:05.764 --> 00:01:07.367
of grass and asphalt.

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.735
There's a refugee camp
where they all live.

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:13.206
-When they meet Luigi,
it's this crazy haunted mansion.

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:15.074
We don't outright
say it's Luigi Mansion,

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:18.645
but I think folks familiar with
Mario lore will put it together.

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:20.980
There's a lot of little
Easter eggs.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.749
That has got to be one
of the most ambitious

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:25.451
pre-tapes I would say.

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:27.920 line:0%
Me and the DP, Lance,
shot the entire car chase

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.690
with toy cars and a go-kart,
just to kind of wrap

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.758
our heads around how
it's going to play out

00:01:32.758 --> 00:01:36.595
and also give to the post team
so we're all on the same page.

00:01:36.595 --> 00:01:37.830
-And turn.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.199 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:41.934
[ Tires squealing ]

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:44.637
[ Both screaming ]

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:47.673 line:0%
-We have an incredible post team
at 30 Rock

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:49.842 line:0%
who collaborated
with crazy talented

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:52.445 line:0%
VFX artists from all over
the country

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:55.247 line:0%
who are working non-stop
from Wednesday

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:56.950 line:0%
right to up air, Saturday.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.186
We used 3D scans of the cast
and the cars,

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:02.354
a lot of digital set extensions,

00:02:02.354 --> 00:02:05.458
and some scenes
were just full CG.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.793
We're excited. I mean,
you get to be a kid again.

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:09.395
Whoo-ho-ho-ho!

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:12.765
-If you're watching this,
I guess we pulled it off.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:13.966
[ Laughs ]

00:02:13.966 --> 00:02:15.368
-That's a wrap on Pedro!

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:16.803
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:18.304
-That was great.

